  "releaseNotes": "2027.1.7: version aligned with the other NovaWpf packages; no change in this package. 2027.1.6: version aligned with the other NovaWpf packages; no change in this package. 2027.1.5: version aligned with the other NovaWpf packages; no change in this package. 2027.1.4: compatibility layer for apps built on Cannoli 4.x (marked Obsolete): the views and view models of Cannoli.Base (ViewBase, WindowViewBase, VisualStateWindowViewBase, DynamicViewModelBase, DynamicStatusViewModelBase, NotifyPropertyViewModel, SimpleViewModelBase and others), RelayCommand, RelayCommand<T> and EventToCommand of Cannoli.Commands, and the command interfaces of Cannoli.Interfaces. The old States enum converts to Cannoli.v2027_1 States in code and in XAML. Used by the command \"Migrate to NovaWpf...\" of the NovaWpf Templates extension. 2027.1.3: version aligned with the other NovaWpf packages; no change in this package. 2027.1.2: version aligned with the other NovaWpf packages; no change in this package. 2027.1.1: version aligned with the other NovaWpf packages; no change in this package.",
